	   the player's own full-screen and play controls in order, so
	   expanding here behaves exactly as it does anywhere else. */
	.ab-screen-open {
		position: absolute;
		top: clamp(0.5rem, 1.4vw, 0.9rem);
		right: clamp(0.5rem, 1.4vw, 0.9rem);
