		gap: 0.35rem;
		padding: 0.34rem 0.7rem 0.34rem 0.55rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
		background: rgba(6, 9, 16, 0.6);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		color: #fff;
